#: ../../source/demos/current_step.rst:2 a8e0ff56032f4902b6c05559187be300
msgid "_`Current step`"
msgstr "_`电流阶跃`"

#: ../../source/demos/current_step.rst:4 0cd256f8f71d49cbb670aa00b3b1eabf
msgid "The q-axis reference jumps 0 → +1 A → −1 A while the motor stays at standstill. This is the sharpest test of the current loop: the integrator sees a full step twice, in opposite directions."
msgstr "电机静止不动，q 轴给定从 0 跳到 +1 A、再跳到 −1 A。这是对电流环最尖锐的考验：积分器要承受两次满幅、方向相反的阶跃。"

#: ../../source/demos/current_step.rst:12 bfeae36feb7e482eafbe88048ed1bf2e
msgid "iq follows the reference within about 1 ms; id is held near zero, with only a coupling blip at the reversal"
msgstr "iq 在约 1 ms 内跟上给定；id 始终贴近零，只在反向时出现一次耦合扰动"

#: ../../source/demos/current_step.rst:15 ad96f108e263489bad5ef8f74efe0ec2
msgid "measured on the +1 A half step"
msgstr "在 +1 A 半段上测得"

