#: ../../source/demos/current_step.rst:19 660edc819af2493381b2099b91e0ae64
msgid "What to look for: no overshoot, no integrator wind-up at the reversal (the second step settles as cleanly as the first), and a d-axis disturbance that stays two orders of magnitude below the q-axis setpoint."
msgstr "看点：没有超调、反向时没有积分饱和（第二次阶跃和第一次一样干净）、d 轴扰动比 q 轴给定低两个数量级。"
